            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbūri y’ijambo ry’Uhoraho yo ku gihugu c’i Haduraki, izoshinga ibande i Damasiko: kukw abantu bose, n’imiryango yose y’Abisirayeli, bahanze amaso Uhoraho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.28.3+EZK.28.4+EZK.28.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 28:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "irishinge n’i Hamati hahereranye na ho, bo n’i Tiro n’i Sidoni, nah’ ar’ abanyabgenge bginshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Tiro biyubakiye igihome, bīrundira amafeza nk’umukungugu, bo n’amazahabu y’indobanurwa nk’ivyondo vyo mu nzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 26:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.28.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamar’ Umwami Imana azobakomvora, azoshiburira ububasha bgaho mu kiyaga, hatōngōrwe n’umuriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababa muri Ashikeloni bazobirāba batinye, n’ababa i Gaza na bo, bazoja mu kajembegete; kand’ ababa muri Ekuroni ivyo bari bishimiye bizobatītūkana; kand’ i Gaza bazobura umwami, no muri Ashikeloni abantu bazohashira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikivyarwa ni co kizogazagaza muri Ashidodi, kand’ Abafilisitiya nzobamara amanyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 3:17",
