              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "51:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nawe, kubg’ amaraso yashinze isezerano rya twe nawe, nanje nkubohoreye imbohe, ndazikūra mu rwobo rutagira amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.61.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 61:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni muhindukirire igihome gikomeye, mwa mbohe ziri n’ivyizigiro: no kur’ uyu musi ndababgira ukuri yuko nzobashumbusha ibihetangabo kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 27:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko mfoye Buyuda nk’umuheto, Efurayimu ndamushize mu ruge; kand’ abana bawe, Siyoni we, nzobateranya n’abana bawe Bugiriki we; nzoguhindura nk’inkota y’umuhizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 18:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 21:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ Uhoraho azoserukira hejuru yabo, umwampi wiwe wirase nk’umuravyo, kand’ Umwami Uhoraho azovuza inzamba, aje mu gihuhuta c’i bumanuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 4:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo azobakīranira; bazoyogeza, basiribange amabuye atewe n’umugozi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "uwo mugozi ni yo mange.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bazoromozwa n’amaraso basāmūke nk’ababorewe vino: bazokwuzura amaraso nk’ inzavya, bahinduke nk’inkokora z’igicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
